# Outfit body (R18): a puffy bomber jacket, rounded corners and sloped shoulders, accent U collar and ribbed waistband,
# steel zip, a glowing sleeve patch. Torso frame as outfit_vest (pivot 4 5 0 on spine_03), one voxel bulkier.
name outfit_bomber
grid 5
size 9 10 12
slot jacket SwatchMain
slot rib SwatchAccent
slot zip Steel
slot patch SwatchGlow
box 0 0 0 9 10 11 jacket
carve box 0 0 0 1 1 11
carve box 8 0 0 9 1 11
carve box 0 9 0 1 10 11
carve box 8 9 0 9 10 11
carve box 0 0 10 9 1 11
carve box 0 9 10 9 10 11
carve box 1 1 0 8 9 10
box 1 2 10 7 8 12 rib
carve box 2 3 10 7 7 12
paint box 0 0 0 9 10 2 rib
paint box 8 4 2 9 6 10 zip
paint box 3 0 7 6 1 9 patch
pivot 4 5 0
